<!-- compose:widget utility/icon - inline SVG icon set.
     Usage (include partial with): name, size?, stroke_width?, classes?
     Icons use currentColor for fill/stroke, parent controls color.
     Stroke-width 1.75 by default for editorial feel.

     Provenance: this set was assembled by hand while the project was being
     built and the source of each glyph was not recorded. It is not all
     original work. On inspection: the `check` and `menu` paths are
     identical to the Heroicons v1 outline icons of the same names;
     `arrow-up-right` has the geometry of the Feather icon of that name;
     `phone` and `external` look like redrawn variants of Heroicons v1
     outlines; the remaining stroke icons (arrows, chevrons, calendar,
     clock, map-pin, search, mail, plus, minus, x, star) are simple
     geometric shapes with no verbatim match found. The filled brand glyphs
     (facebook, linkedin, twitter, tiktok, youtube, venmo, and the outlined
     instagram) are the respective companies' logos in the single-path form
     that brand icon collections distribute; the linkedin and youtube paths
     read like coordinate-rounded copies of the Simple Icons paths. The
     logos are trademarks of their owners. -->
